{"type":"message","message":{"id":"gen-1775332803-EREcwjz4bTBepYYuyri4","role":"assistant","created":1775332813,"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see! The table structure in 1949 is different. Looking at the pattern:\n- `<tr><td></td><td>Total</td><td>36,068</td>` - this is for year 1949\n\nThe pattern is different in different years. Let me update my extraction to handle both patterns.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_2380efdfdc3d4e51990d641c","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOF'\nimport re\n\ndef extract_all_fixed_maturity_totals_v2(content):\n    \"\"\"Extract all Total values from fixed maturity column - handle multiple patterns\"\"\"\n    # Pattern 1: <tr><td>Total.</td><td></td><td>46,615</td>\n    pattern1 = r'<tr><td>Total\\.</td><td></td><td>([0-9,]+)'\n    totals1 = re.findall(pattern1, content)\n    \n    # Pattern 2: <tr><td></td><td>Total</td><td>36,068</td>  (for 1949 onwards)\n    pattern2 = r'<tr><td></td><td>Total</td><td>([0-9,]+)'\n    totals2 = re.findall(pattern2, content)\n    \n    all_totals = totals1 + totals2\n    return [int(t.replace(',', '')) for t in all_totals]\n\n# Read files\nwith open('/app/resources/treasury_bulletin_1948_03_page_28.txt', 'r') as f:\n    content_1948 = f.read()\n\nwith open('/app/resources/treasury_bulletin_1949_03_page_29.txt', 'r') as f:\n    content_1949 = f.read()\n\nwith open('/app/resources/treasury_bulletin_1950_03_page_31.txt', 'r') as f:\n    content_1950 = f.read()\n\nwith open('/app/resources/treasury_bulletin_1951_03_page_32.txt', 'r') as f:\n    content_1951 = f.read()\n\nprint(\"1948 document (Jan 31, 1948):\")\ntotals_1948 = extract_all_fixed_maturity_totals_v2(content_1948)\nprint(f\"  Fixed maturity totals: {totals_1948}\")\nprint(f\"  Sum: {sum(totals_1948)}\")\n\nprint(\"\\n1949 document (Jan 31, 1949):\")\ntotals_1949 = extract_all_fixed_maturity_totals_v2(content_1949)\nprint(f\"  Fixed maturity totals: {totals_1949}\")\nprint(f\"  Sum: {sum(totals_1949)}\")\n\nprint(\"\\n1950 document (Jan 31, 1950):\")\ntotals_1950 = extract_all_fixed_maturity_totals_v2(content_1950)\nprint(f\"  Fixed maturity totals: {totals_1950}\")\nprint(f\"  Sum: {sum(totals_1950)}\")\n\nprint(\"\\n1951 document (Jan 31, 1951):\")\ntotals_1951 = extract_all_fixed_maturity_totals_v2(content_1951)\nprint(f\"  Fixed maturity totals: {totals_1951}\")\nprint(f\"  Sum: {sum(totals_1951)}\")\n\nEOF"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
